{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.BuildingBlockKnots","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.BuildingBlockKnots","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":36,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossing_energy_at_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossing_energy_at_substrate","kind":"theorem","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L254-L264","doc":"The crossing energy at q₀: E_×(q₀) ≈ 0.1045. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_electron_ratio_not_within_thousandth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_electron_ratio_not_within_thousandth","kind":"theorem","line":241,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L241-L252","doc":"**The previously-claimed bound is false**, recorded so the correction cannot\nsilently regress.\n\nThe docstring above once asserted agreement \"to within 0.001\".  The ratio sits\n`0.0044746` BELOW `206.768`, so that claim fails on the lower side — which is\nwhy the proof takes the `left` disjunct.  Writing it with `right` leaves a bare\n`False` goal and reads like the claim being true. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_electron_ratio_from_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_electron_ratio_from_substrate","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L199-L239","doc":"At the CODATA substrate parameter q₀, the muon-electron mass\nratio matches the experimental value 206.768 to within 0.00448.\n\n**Corrected 2026-08-30 (bean `qou-2u39`).**  This docstring claimed\n\"to within 0.001\" over a theorem proving only `< 1`.  Both numbers were\nwrong in opposite directions: the true deviation is `0.0044746`, so\n`0.001` is FALSE — `¬ (|… − 206.768| < 0.001)` is itself provable here —\nwhile `< 1` was 224× looser than what holds.  The bound below is now the\nmeasured one, and the prose states exactly what the Lean carries.\n\nThe tightening cost nothing: the tactic is unchanged.  The arithmetic is\nrational and exact, so `norm_num` is indifferent to the tolerance.\n\n**Do NOT read `0.00448` as a framework-vs-experiment result.**  Measured at\n50 dps, the deviation is driven almost entirely by the SIX-DIGIT `q₀` literal\nabove, not by the framework and not by the `Vol(4₁)` truncation:\n\n    q₀ = 1.10998            (this file)      dev = 4.76e-3\n    q₀ = 1.1099785827513808 (proton pin)     dev = 4.34e-5\n    q₀ = 1.109978595642739  (muon, CODATA22) dev = 3.0e-7\n\nand at every one of those, the 15-digit `vol_figure_eight` and the exact\n`2·Cl₂(π/3)` give the same ratio to 12 printed digits — so the volume literal\ncontributes nothing at all.  A third truncation is in play too: the comparison\ntarget `206.768` is itself `2.83e-4` from the CODATA `206.7682830`.\n\n**And the tight agreement at the muon pin is not evidence either.**  That pin\nis DEFINED by inverting this very relation (`m_μ/m_e = Vol(4₁)/ℏ_q²`, AGENTS.md\n§canonical chain), so `3.0e-7` there is the CAL-2 calibration tautology, not an\naccuracy win — the same thing AGENTS.md forbids reporting as one for `m_μ`.\n\nWhat this theorem honestly states is therefore an *arithmetic* fact about the\nliterals in this file, and nothing more. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_electron_ratio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_electron_ratio","kind":"def","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L193-L197","doc":"The muon-electron mass ratio is Vol(4₁)/ℏ_q² (leading term),\nderived purely from q. At q₀ this matches CODATA 206.768. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.muon_mass","kind":"def","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L186-L191","doc":"The muon mass as a function of q (in μ₀ units).\nThe muon is the figure-eight knot 4₁ with Vol(4₁) = 2.02988\nand 4 crossings: m_μ = Vol(4₁)/ℏ_q² + 4 · E_×(q).\nThe ratio m_μ/m_e = Vol(4₁)/ℏ_q² determines q₀. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.electron_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.electron_mass","kind":"def","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L180-L184","doc":"The electron mass as a function of q (in μ₀ units).\nThe electron is the trefoil knot T_{2,3} with 3 crossings\nand zero hyperbolic volume, so m_e = 3 · E_×(q) · μ₀. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.hbarQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.hbarQ","kind":"def","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L177-L178","doc":"The quantum Planck constant: ℏ_q = 1 - q⁻¹. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossing_energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossing_energy","kind":"def","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L172-L175","doc":"The crossing energy at substrate parameter q:\nE_×(q) = (1/2)(q - q⁻¹). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.q₀_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.q₀_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L169-L170","doc":"q₀ > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.q₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.q₀","kind":"def","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L164-L167","doc":"The CODATA substrate parameter q₀ ≈ 1.1097, the unique root q > 1\nof `(1 - q⁻¹)² = Vol(4₁)/(m_μ/m_e)`.\nSee `QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.unknot_amphichiral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.unknot_amphichiral","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L151-L158","doc":"The unknot is amphichiral: J(q) = J(q⁻¹) = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.figure_eight_amphichiral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.figure_eight_amphichiral","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L141-L149","doc":"The figure-eight knot is amphichiral: J(q) = J(q⁻¹). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_unknot_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_unknot_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L133-L135","doc":"The unknot Jones polynomial equals 1 for all q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_cinquefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_cinquefoil","kind":"def","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L123-L127","doc":"Jones polynomial of the cinquefoil 5₁.\nJ(q) = -q⁻¹⁰ + q⁻⁹ - q⁻⁸ + q⁻⁷ + q⁻⁵ ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_figure_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_figure_eight","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L117-L121","doc":"Jones polynomial of the figure-eight knot 4₁.\nJ(q) = q² - q + 1 - q⁻¹ + q⁻² ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_mirror_trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_mirror_trefoil","kind":"def","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L111-L115","doc":"Jones polynomial of the right (mirror) trefoil 3̄₁.\nJ(q) = -q⁴ + q³ + q ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_trefoil","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L105-L109","doc":"Jones polynomial of the left trefoil 3₁.\nJ(q) = -q⁻⁴ + q⁻³ + q⁻¹ ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_unknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.jones_unknot","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L101-L103","doc":"Jones polynomial of the unknot is identically 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_T35","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_T35","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L95-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_T34","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_T34","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L94-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_septafoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_septafoil","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L93-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_three_twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_three_twist","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L92-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_cinquefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_cinquefoil","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L91-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_figure_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_figure_eight","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L90-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_trefoil","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L89-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_unknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.crossings_unknot","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L86-L88","doc":"Crossing numbers of building block knots. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.torus_knots_nonhyperbolic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.torus_knots_nonhyperbolic","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L75-L80","doc":"Every torus knot is non-hyperbolic: Vol(T_{m,n}) = 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_borromean","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L67-L69","doc":"Vol(L6a4) = 7.32772475341775 (Borromean rings, exact: 8·G). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_hopf_link","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_hopf_link","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L63-L65","doc":"Vol(L2a1) = 0 (Hopf link, torus link → non-hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_T34","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_T34","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L59-L61","doc":"Vol(8₁₉) = 0 (T_{3,4} torus knot → non-hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_septafoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_septafoil","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L55-L57","doc":"Vol(7₁) = 0 (septafoil, torus knot → non-hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_three_twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_three_twist","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L51-L53","doc":"Vol(5₂) = 2.82812208833 (three-twist knot, hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_cinquefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_cinquefoil","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L47-L49","doc":"Vol(5₁) = 0 (cinquefoil, torus knot → non-hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_figure_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_figure_eight","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L41-L45","doc":"Vol(4₁) ≈ 2.02988321281930 (figure-eight; the exact value is 2·Cl₂(π/3),\nwhich this 15-digit literal truncates -- they differ at the 16th digit,\nso the relation is `≈` and not `=` per AGENTS.md §7ab). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_trefoil","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L37-L39","doc":"Vol(3₁) = 0 (trefoil, torus knot → non-hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_unknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BuildingBlockKnots.vol_unknot","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/building-block-knots.lean#L33-L35","doc":"Vol(0₁) = 0 (unknot, non-hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0}]}